# The cornered chicken, as data (the sim.rs test a_fox_eats_a_cornered_chicken
# in its chunk and across a border): two pens of rock, each round a hen and open only
# where a starving fox stands. The second straddles the border between
# chunks (0, 0) and (1, 0) at x = 64. Within 64 ticks each fox bites twice
# (a hen has 20 health, a fox bites 10) and eats its hen.
seed 3
outside soil
map {
  ..................................................................
  .###...........................................................###
  .FC#...........................................................FC#
  .###...........................................................###
  ..................................................................
}
legend {
  . soil
  # rock
  C chicken
  F fox with (food = 2h)     # starving: it hunts at once
}

run 64
expect count chicken == 0          # both hens eaten
expect eaten chicken == 2
expect count fox == 2
expect min food of fox > 23h       # a hen is a fox's day: each ate a whole one
